    <p class="reveal reveal-right d1">I'm a Computer Programmer I at PHilMech (Philippine Center for Postharvest Development and Mechanization), where I build full-stack and 3D web systems for government projects. My current focus is a Virtual Biobank for Stored Arthropods — built with ASP.NET, PostgreSQL, and a Linux data warehouse server — alongside an explorable virtual museum featuring interactive insect model viewers built with A-Frame and Three.js. I'm drawn to work that makes data more accessible and engaging, whether that's through backend systems or immersive 3D experiences.</p>

